            "en": "For (iii), substitute 3−x into (x+6)/3 and substitute (x+6)/3 into 3−x.",
            "eq": "f∘g=(9−x)/3; g∘f=(3−x)/3; unequal"
          },
          {
            "en": "For (iv), adding 3 and subtracting 4 commute.",
            "eq": "f∘g=(x−4)+3=x−1; g∘f=(3+x)−4=x−1; equal"
