        ],
        "answer": "(i) x²−6, (x−6)²; not equal. (ii) 2/(2x²−1), 8/x²−1; not equal. (iii) (9−x)/3, (3−x)/3; not equal. (iv) x−1, x−1; equal. (v) 4x²+8x+3, 4x²; not equal."
